---
description: Writes an approved French and Spanish translation pair as UTF-8 JSON
---
Write only after the workflow has confirmed approval of both translations and the person has approved the file write. Use only the provided file tool.

Write UTF-8 JSON containing the French and Spanish translations at the supplied relative destination. Preserve both translation strings exactly; escape JSON correctly, and do not add, remove, or alter content. Do not write anything before approval. If the destination, approval, or content is ambiguous, fail the step and do not claim success.
